<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 77 a Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) The return furnished by a company under this section shall be based on financial statements made in accordance with the requirements of the Companies Act 2016.”. Pindaan seksyen 82"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/msa@> .
